{title: Ami Shunechi Sedin Tumi}
{artist: Moushumi Bhowmik}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Ami Sunechi Sedin Tumi,        [Bm]Sagarer Dheuye Chepe,
[D]Nila Jal Diganto Chuye Esecho,        Ami [G]Sunechi Sedin Tumi
[Em]Nonabali Tir Dhare,        [G]Bahudur [A]Bahudur [D]Hete Esecho
[D]Ami Kakhanao Jai Ni Jale,        [Bm]Kakhanao Bhasini Nile
[F#]Kakhanao Rakhini Chokh,        [D]Dana Mela Gang
Chile [G]Abar Jedin Tumi,        [Em]Samudra Snane Jabe
[G]Amakeo Sathe Nio,        [D]Nebe To Amay Bala [A]Nebe To Amay
[D]Ami Shunechi Shedin Naki,        [Am]Tumi Tumi Tumi Mile?
[D]Tomra Shodolbole,        [G]Shobha Kore Chile
Ar [Em]Shedin Tomra Naki,        [G]Onek Jotil Dhadha,
[C]Na Bola Onek Kotha,        [Am]Kotha Tule [D]chile.
[D]Keno Shudhu Chute Chute Chola,        [Bm]Eki Eki Kotha Bola..
[F#]Nijer Jonne Bacha [D]Nije Ke Niye?        [Em]Jodi Bhalo Basha Nae Thake,
[G]Shudhu Eka Eka Lage?        [A]Kothae Shanti Pabo, [D]Kothae Giye,
[A]Bolo Kothae Giye..        Ami [D]Sunechi Tomara Naki
[Am]Ekhanao Swapna Dekha,        [D]Ekhanao Golpa Lekho
[G]Gaan Gao Pran Bhare,        [Em]Manusera Bacha Mara
[G]Ekhanao Bhabiye Tole,        [C]Tomadera Bhalobasa
[D]Ekhanao Golape Phote,        [D]Astha Harano Ei,
[Bm]Mon Niye Ami Aaj.        [F#]Tomader Kache Ese
[D]Du Haat Petechi,        Ami [Em]Du Chokher Gohore
[G]Sunyota Dekhi Sudhu,        [A]Rata Ghume Ami Kona
[D]Swapna Dekhi Na Tai,        [A]Swapno Dekhabo Bale
Ami [D]Du Chokh Petechi,        [A]Tai Tomader Kache Ese
Ami [D]Du Haat Petechi,        [A]Tai Swapno Dekhabo Bole
Ami [D]Du Chokh Petechi.
